# The scenario editor on the first Allied mission: its right-click menu, the
# AI menu, the team list and the team dialog.
# args: -EDITOR
at 200 shot editor
at 201 rclick 400 150
at 240 shot main_menu
at 241 key DOWN
at 245 key DOWN
at 249 key DOWN
at 253 key DOWN
at 257 key DOWN
at 261 key DOWN
at 271 key RETURN
at 310 shot ai_menu
at 311 key DOWN
at 315 key DOWN
at 320 key RETURN
at 360 shot team_list
at 361 click 160 225
at 400 shot team_dialog
at 401 click 345 225
at 440 shot team_list_again
at 441 quit
